{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>In her father's house.</b> Under her father's authority, even if she is not in his house (ibid.)." "<b>In her youth.</b> And not a minor and not an adult woman — the minor's vow is not a vow, and the adult woman is not under her father's authority to annul her vows. And which is a minor? Our Sages said: a girl of eleven years and one day — her vows are examined: if she knows in whose name she vowed and in whose name she consecrated, her vow is a vow. A girl of twelve years and one day does not need examination."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:13:16.631770123Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}